sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator
    participant MLflowCR as MLflow CR
    participant Reconciler as MLflowReconciler
    participant ModuleCR as MLflowOperator CR
    participant Helm as Helm Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MigJob as Migration Job Pod
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL<br/>5432/3306 TCP
    participant NSRBAC as NamespaceRBACReconciler
    participant AuthCR as Auth CR

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: MLflow CR Reconciliation
        User->>MLflowCR: Create/Update MLflow CR
        MLflowCR->>Reconciler: Watch event (K8s Watch, TLS)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Check MLflowOperator readiness<br/>HTTPS/TLS, ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Module status
        Reconciler->>Helm: Render chart with CR spec values
        Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests<br/>(Deployment, Service, NetworkPolicy,<br/>PVC, SA, ClusterRole, ServiceMonitor)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply rendered objects<br/>HTTPS/TLS, ServiceAccount
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>(parent: data-science-gateway)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConsoleLink
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Applied successfully
        Reconciler->>MLflowCR: Update status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Reconciler,DB: Flow 2: Database Migration
        Reconciler->>Reconciler: Detect MLflow version mismatch<br/>or force-migrate annotation
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Scale Deployment to 0 replicas<br/>HTTPS/TLS
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create migration Job<br/>(same image, TLS certs, CA bundles)
        K8sAPI-->>MigJob: Pod scheduled
        MigJob->>DB: Run mlflow_db_migrate.py<br/>TLS (optional via PGSSLMODE)<br/>DB credentials
        DB-->>MigJob: Migration result
        MigJob-->>K8sAPI: Job status (exit code)<br/>0=success, 1=terminal, 2=retryable
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Watch Job status<br/>HTTPS/TLS
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Job completed/failed
        alt Migration Success
            Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Restore Deployment replicas<br/>HTTPS/TLS
        else Terminal Failure
            Reconciler->>MLflowCR: Mark migration failed (sticky)
            Note over Reconciler: Requires force-migrate<br/>annotation to retry
        end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over NSRBAC,AuthCR: Flow 3: Workspace Namespace RBAC
        Note over NSRBAC: Namespace label change<br/>(opendatahub.io/global-mlflow-workspace)
        NSRBAC->>K8sAPI: Detect labeled namespace<br/>K8s Watch, TLS
        NSRBAC->>AuthCR: Read allowedGroups, adminGroups<br/>K8s API, TLS
        AuthCR-->>NSRBAC: Group lists
        NSRBAC->>K8sAPI: Apply RoleBindings<br/>(odh-group-mlflow-view,<br/>odh-group-mlflow-edit)<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    end
